  "goodToKnow": "Das Mandat has three main uses: a parliamentary seat (ein Mandat im Bundestag, Direktmandat, Überhangmandat), a political mandate (ein Mandat der UNO), and a lawyer's brief, where the client is der Mandant. In the Bundestag, a Direktmandat is won in an electoral constituency by the most first votes. Er gab sein Mandat zurück means he gave up his seat."
